  "created": "2026-03-07T09:30:03.27Z",
  "description": "## What's New in v4.7.0\n\n### OpenAI Model Expansion\n- Added `gpt-5.3-codex`, `gpt-5.4`, `gpt-5.4-pro` model support\n- New `Gpt5_3Reasoning` and `Gpt5_4Reasoning` enums\n- New fluent APIs: `WithGpt5_3Parameters(...)`, `WithGpt5_4Parameters(...)`\n\n### OpenAI Reasoning Streaming Improvements\n- Improved parsing for reasoning delta/done events (`response.reasoning_text.*`, `response.reasoning_summary_text.done`)\n- Added support for summary array payload extraction (`summary[].text`)\n- More reliable reasoning chunk delivery in mixed event formats\n\n### Gemini Reasoning Streaming Improvements\n- Streaming requests now propagate reasoning intent via `includeThoughts`\n- Function-calling streaming path also carries `includeThoughts`\n- Parser prioritizes thought chunks when reasoning is requested\n\n## Supported Models\n\n### OpenAI\n- GPT-5, GPT-5 Mini, GPT-5 Nano, GPT-5 Chat Latest\n- GPT-5.1\n- GPT-5.2, GPT-5.2 Pro, GPT-5.2 Codex\n- GPT-5.3 Codex\n- GPT-5.4, GPT-5.4 Pro\n- o3, o3-pro\n- GPT-4.1, GPT-4.1 Mini, GPT-4.1 Nano\n- GPT-4o, GPT-4o Mini, GPT-4 Vision\n\n### Anthropic Claude\n- Claude Opus 4.6, Opus 4.5, Opus 4.1, Opus 4\n- Claude Sonnet 4.6, Sonnet 4.5, Sonnet 4\n- Claude Haiku 4.5\n\n### xAI Grok\n- Grok 4, Grok 4.1 Fast\n- Grok 3, Grok 3 Mini\n\n### Google Gemini\n- Gemini 2.5 Pro, Flash, Flash-Lite\n- Gemini 3 Pro Preview, Flash Preview\n\n### DeepSeek\n- DeepSeek Chat, DeepSeek Reasoner\n\n### Perplexity\n- Sonar, Sonar Pro, Sonar Reasoning\n\n## Documentation\n- Basic Usage: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/wiki\n- Advanced Features: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/wiki/Advanced-Features\n- Release Notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/wiki/Release-Notes\n- GitHub: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI",
